MPelyoffice does not ship fonts: the machine that runs the kernel
has the fonts, and the package stays small.  The module that fetches the Noto,
DejaVu and Liberation families is therefore empty, so the build neither
downloads nor installs them.

The fonts are only used for the list in the font box and for the samples in
the tests; the kernel lays out with the fonts of the machine that runs it.
